<title>USA: CCC buys 10,530 tonnes HRW wheat for Bangladesh.</title>
<headline>CCC buys 10,530 tonnes HRW wheat for Bangladesh.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it purchased a total of 10,530 tonnes of U.S. hard red winter wheat for export to Bangladesh.</p>
<p>The wheat comprised 5,870 tonnes from ADM at $170.15 a tonne and 4,660 tonnes from Farmland at $170.98 a tonne, all FOB Galveston. The wheat is for delivery between March 15 and April 10, CCC said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
